# Shared by Docker Compose (backend + worker). Never commit this file.
# Flask also loads this file when you run locally from backend/.
#
# Changing SECRET_KEY makes a previously saved OpenAI key unreadable unless you
# re-encrypt it. See README.md (SECRET_KEY / Rotating the passphrase).
#
# The frontend must not receive this value. Redis stores ciphertext only; the
# planner worker decrypts on the server when it calls OpenAI.
SECRET_KEY=
